cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "MadVoro: Massively distributed construction of 3D Voronoi diagrams"
version: 1.0.0
license: BSD-3-Clause
type: software
abstract: >-
  MadVoro is a C++ library for massively distributed construction of 3D
  Voronoi diagrams. It provides the Voronoi tessellation engine used by the
  RICH astrophysical simulation code and can also be used as a standalone
  library in other applications.
message: "If you use MadVoro in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
authors:
  - given-names: Maor
    family-names: Mizrachi
  - given-names: Elad
    family-names: Steinberg
keywords:
  - Voronoi tessellation
  - Delaunay triangulation
  - high-performance computing
  - distributed computing
  - MPI
  - computational geometry
